{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act50side_level_act50side_02_beg","storyGroup":"act50side","storySort":4,"storyDependence":"act50side_level_act50side_01_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TD-2","storyName":"还我锅来！","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"梓兰和空爆认为这一切都是个骗局，两人决定逃跑，并分头行动——空爆调查其余三人的状况，梓兰为逃跑做准备。然而……","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act50side/level_act50side_02_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act50side_02","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":2,"next":4,"characters":["搬运的武士","空爆","梓兰","泡影国百姓A","工坊学徒","斑弥罗","宝巫迦","？？？","政宗"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_bg_71_g1_impermanence_street.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"multiline","name":"空爆","text":"该从哪里开始调查呢，","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":12},{"type":"multiline","name":"空爆","text":"咦，那边的是——","id":13},{"type":"charslot","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"搬运的武士","text":"小心点，别磕到了。","id":15},{"type":"dialog","id":16},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-500,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1.5","id":19},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":20},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_282_catap_1#5$1","focus":"r","duration":"1","id":24},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"呃，你们在干嘛呢？","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"搬运的武士","text":"是“异兽猎人”阁下啊。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"搬运的武士","text":"我们正在把这具熔火蜗的尸体运往宫中。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"不是要把它的壳做成什么炭吗，为什么要把它搬到宫里去？","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"搬运的武士","text":"因为它的肉经过陛下的净化，还可以成为食材。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"搬运的武士","text":"而且，这十年来，由于“雷之主”的存在，我们能够狩猎的范围越来越小，哪怕是一点食物，我们也不能浪费。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_282_catap_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"净化？泡……宝巫迦陛下真的能做到这种事吗？","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"搬运的武士","text":"没错，这也是陛下之所以是陛下的原因。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"搬运的武士","text":"有些事，只有陛下才能做到。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_282_catap_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"也就是说，你们现在正要把这具尸体拿去让陛下净化？","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"我能去看看是怎么净化的吗？","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"搬运的武士","text":"……抱歉，陛下进行净化的场所，是祭祀重地，即使是“异兽猎人”，也不能轻易进入。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"搬运的武士","text":"如果您真的想知道，请去向将军阁下或者陛下本人获得许可吧。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"搬运的武士","text":"别发呆，继续，陛下还在等着我们呢！","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":47},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":48},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"1.5","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"300,0","duration":"1.5","afrom":"1","ato":"0","focus":"l","id":50},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":51},{"type":"charslot","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"嘁，你们的陛下在准备净化，你们的将军，呃，反正我也不知道在哪……这不就是不让我看的意思嘛。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"哼，你们不让我看，我非要看。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"我倒要搞清楚，这个地方到底是怎么一回事！","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":59},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":60},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":61},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":62},{"type":"dialog","id":63},{"type":"charslot","id":64},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_bg_71_g1_impermanence_street.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":65},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":66},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":67,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":68},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"m","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"……","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#5","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"（假设我的行为在监控之下，那么刚才我看到的那一切都是演戏吗？）","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_char_278_orchid_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"（有什么方法能找到这里的漏洞呢……）","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"（咦，这么说来，这里好像不是一座移动城市？）","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":78},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"1.5","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","afrom":"0","ato":"1","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2108_1#1$1","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"l","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"请问，这座城市可以移动吗？","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2108_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓A","text":"“异兽猎人”阁下，您这个问题真是够奇怪的。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_2108_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓A","text":"城市怎么会移动呢？打我记事以来，我已经看着这座“御轮”几十年啦。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_2108_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#3","focus":"l","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"……没有移动城市，那你们怎么应付天灾？","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_char_278_orchid_3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2108_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓A","text":"天灾？天灾又是什么？","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_2108_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"l","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"天灾就是，呃，类似“异兽”一样的灾难？","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2108_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓A","text":"没听说过。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_2108_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#3","focus":"l","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你们这里的人从没得过矿石病？","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_char_278_orchid_3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2108_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓A","text":"矿石病？","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_2108_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"l","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"就是身上会长石头的病——","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":104},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":106},{"type":"charslot","id":107},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"60","vibrato":"70","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.7","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"0.02","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_sp_ballista","id":110},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_statuecollapse","volume":"1","id":111},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"0.25","block":"true","id":112},{"type":"text","text":"……嘭！","id":113},{"type":"text","text":"远处的房舍突然传出一声巨响，奇形怪状的竹制器物被抛到了半空之中。","id":114},{"type":"text","text":"一把铳炮一样的物体猛然坠落，带着火花滑行到众人脚边。","id":115},{"type":"text","text":"接着是缓缓飘落的屋顶……","id":116},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":117},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":118,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","id":119},{"type":"dialog","id":120},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2109_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","afrom":"0","ato":"1","id":122},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":123},{"type":"charslot","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#3","focus":"m","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"怎么了？","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_char_278_orchid_3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2109_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工坊学徒","text":"呼，呼——快、快来人，不好了！斑弥罗大人的工坊爆炸了！","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2109_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2108_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓A","text":"斑弥罗大人不是天天都会搞些动静出来吗，放着他不管就好吧。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_2108_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2109_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工坊学徒","text":"不一样，他今天去仓库里取了一些熔火蜗的壳，说是要做个大家伙。","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2109_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工坊学徒","text":"结果，结果——他现在身上插了好几块石头！快去帮帮他！","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2109_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#3","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"（……等等，熔火蜗的壳，那不就是源石虫背上的源石结晶吗！如果那些源石结晶爆炸的话——）","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_char_278_orchid_3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#4","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"（我真是个蠢材，刚才看到那些熔火蜗尸体的时候就该想到的！）","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_char_278_orchid_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#2","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"（如果是源石爆炸……）","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_char_278_orchid_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"m","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"（啧，他会死的！）","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":142},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":144},{"type":"dialog","id":145},{"type":"charslot","id":146},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_bg_71_g2_impermanence_room.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":147},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":149},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":150},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"疼疼疼……","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":154},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_door","volume":"1","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","afrom":"0","ato":"1","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"l","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"斑点！","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"我是斑弥罗！疼疼……","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#3","focus":"l","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你没事吧！","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_char_278_orchid_3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"给铳枪加个压，没想到这玩意这么不经折腾。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"本来以为“火竹炭”当作弹药应该还挺坚硬的，结果一开火就碎开了，炸得到处都是……","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"l","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"让我看看！","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"啊？这有什么好看的，小伤而已。我早就习惯了——哎，疼，你轻点！","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"l","id":171},{"type":"multiline","name":"梓兰","text":"小伤？！这可是源石爆……","id":172},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#3","focus":"l","id":174},{"type":"multiline","name":"梓兰","text":"炸……？","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#3","focus":"l","id":176},{"type":"text","text":"梓兰认真看了一眼地上的结晶碎片。","id":177},{"type":"text","text":"多年的经验让她已经能够一眼判断出一块结晶是不是源石结晶。","id":178},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":179,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#5","focus":"l","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"这些……是普通的结晶，不是源石……？","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_char_278_orchid_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"源石是什么？","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"l","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"源石虫的背上应该有大量的源石结晶，如果被那些结晶划伤，应该会加重你的矿石病——","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"矿石病？那又是什么？","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#3","focus":"l","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"……？！","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_char_278_orchid_3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"1","id":191},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"喂，你要干什么？！","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"别靠近我，我要喊人了——","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"救命啊——","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","id":200},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"60","randomness":"10","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":201},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":202},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":203},{"type":"text","text":"梓兰猛地掀开斑弥罗的上衣。","id":204},{"type":"text","text":"梓兰知道，在斑点肚脐眼旁边，应该有两块突出的源石结晶。","id":205},{"type":"text","text":"但是，斑弥罗的肚子上，只有长得很健康的毛发。","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"l","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你的身上有没有长一种石头？","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"没有。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#5","focus":"l","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"……","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_char_278_orchid_5.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"难道你真的不是斑点？","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_char_278_orchid_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"我早就说过了，我叫斑弥罗！","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#4","focus":"l","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"怎么可能……","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_char_278_orchid_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"你这么信誓旦旦，连我都要怀疑我是不是其实叫斑点了……","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"l","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"对了，还有一种可能性……","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#3","focus":"l","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你是去拿了一袋熔火蜗背上的石头，对吧？","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_char_278_orchid_3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"那又怎么了？","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"l","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"那些石头存放的仓库在哪？","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"宫廷侧面，那座比较高的屋子。","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"l","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我知道了。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#5","focus":"l","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"（没错，还有一种可能性——）","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_char_278_orchid_5.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"（将熔火蜗，也就是源石虫的尸体收集起来，不是为了什么做成“火竹炭”，而是……）","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_char_278_orchid_5.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"（有人想要掩盖这里存在源石这个事实。）","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_char_278_orchid_5.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"（我必须找到熔火蜗的尸体。）","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_char_278_orchid_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","focus":"l","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"谢谢你，好好休息。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_char_278_orchid_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":240},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"1","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_278_orchid_1#1","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"1.5","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"喂，喂！","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"真是个莫名其妙的女人。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":249},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":250},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":251},{"type":"dialog","id":252},{"type":"charslot","id":253},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_bg_71_g3_impermanence_palace.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":254},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":255},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":256},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":259},{"type":"text","text":"空爆轻巧地跳过几根横梁，没有发出一丝声响。","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"噢，好险好险，还好这里的人警戒心不怎么强。","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"这里就是泡普卡举行仪式的地方了吧。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"让我看一看，她到底在干什么……","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":267},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":268},{"type":"text","text":"刚才被武士们拖进房间的熔火蜗尸体，静静地躺在那里。","id":269},{"type":"text","text":"午后的阳光照射进房间内，尸体上正在冒出的黑气尤为明显。","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"那“诅咒”究竟是什么东西？","id":271},{"type":"charslot","id":272},{"type":"text","text":"空旷的房间中央，身为国主的宝巫迦，坐在尸体前方，口中正在默念着什么。","id":273},{"type":"text","text":"而在她的背后，整齐地跪坐着两排头戴面巾的侍女。","id":274},{"type":"text","text":"万籁无声。","id":275},{"type":"text","text":"一切都显得神圣而诡异。","id":276},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_slbellbtl","volume":"1","id":277},{"type":"text","text":"“铃——”","id":278},{"type":"text","text":"“以吾身为囚——”","id":279},{"type":"text","text":"随着一声铃声响起，侍女们齐齐开口，唱起了一首乐曲，而宝巫迦也跟着乐曲开始舞蹈。","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"而后，令空爆感到不可思议的一幕发生了……","id":281},{"type":"text","text":"那些黑气，竟然就像被什么东西牵引一般，从尸体上被剥离。","id":282},{"type":"text","text":"如果用一个她能想象到的最直观的比喻来形容，那就是这些黑气，就像是被吸尘器吸走了一样。","id":283},{"type":"dialog","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":285},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":286},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_purifymagic","volume":"1","channel":"5","id":287},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_light","x":"-9","y":"-67","layer":"1","id":288},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"5","fadetime":"2.5","id":289},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":290},{"type":"bgeffect","duration":"2","id":291},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":292},{"type":"text","text":"而那台吸尘器，毫无疑问是正在舞蹈的宝巫迦。","id":293},{"type":"text","text":"随着舞蹈的进行，宝巫迦身上逐渐蒙上了一层淡淡的光芒，黑气往她的身上聚集，并最终被她吸收。","id":294},{"type":"charslot","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（等等……她的表情好难受……那些尸体上的黑气……都跑到她身上去了！）","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（对了，泡普卡的眼睛是很特殊没错……难道就是为了这个，泡普卡才变成了这样？）","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（可恶！这根本不是什么净化，这是在折磨她！我就知道有问题！他们竟然通过这种方式来利用她！）","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（不行，我看不下去了。必须得阻止她！）","id":299},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":301},{"type":"charslot","id":302},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":303,"musicid":4},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#4$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":305},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"你们真是好大的胆子！","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"空爆小姐？！","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"快退下，吾的仪式尚未结束，“诅咒”会伤到你的！","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"退下？怎么可能。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"别再被他们骗了！这个仪式有问题，他们在折磨你！我来带你走！","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"折磨？不——","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":318},{"type":"charslot","id":319},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":320},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swordwhoosh","volume":"1","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":322},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$6","duration":"2","id":324},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":325},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice1","volume":"1","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"陛下，请继续仪式喵。","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"这家伙由我政宗来对付喵。","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"……好，吾会尽快结束。","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":331},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":332},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":333},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"会说话的云兽……？","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$6","focus":"m","id":336},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice3","volume":"1","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"不是云兽，是政宗喵！","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$6","focus":"m","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"听说这一代的“异兽猎人”来了，就赶回来看看……","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$6","focus":"m","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"没想到是这么不讲理的家伙喵。","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_282_catap_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"不讲理？不讲理的是你们才对！","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_282_catap_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$6","focus":"m","id":345},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice3","volume":"1","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"你根本不理解这里在发生什么……就让我来告诉你喵。","id":347},{"type":"dialog","id":348},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":349},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":350},{"type":"bgeffect","id":351},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":352},{"type":"image","id":353},{"type":"charslot","id":354}],"characters":["搬运的武士","空爆","梓兰","泡影国百姓A","工坊学徒","斑弥罗","宝巫迦","？？？","政宗"]}